1
00:00:00,067 --> 00:00:01,827
(Sheldon:)She's hooked.

2
00:00:11,478 --> 00:00:13,968
(Raj:)Wow, an end of an era.

3
00:00:14,614 --> 00:00:18,174
(Howard:)Boy, if these walls could talk.

4
00:00:19,252 --> 00:00:22,382
(Leonard:)They'd say,
"Why does he touch himself so much?"

5
00:00:27,694 --> 00:00:28,754
(Howard:)Yeah.

6
00:00:31,198 --> 00:00:34,468
(Howard:)I can't believe
I'm not gonna live here anymore.

7
00:00:34,634 --> 00:00:37,964
(Howard:)This has always been my bedroom.

8
00:00:38,138 --> 00:00:41,738
(Howard:)Right here is where my mom
used to mark my height.

9
00:00:41,908 --> 00:00:43,468
(Leonard:)Oh, yeah.

10
00:00:43,643 --> 00:00:50,013
"Fifth grade, sixth grade,
seventh grade, eighth grade, ninth grade."

11
00:00:51,151 --> 00:00:54,311
Yeah, I remember when I was 5...

12
00:00:54,521 --> 00:00:57,821
(Howard:)...hiding under this desk
with all my Halloween candy.

13
00:00:58,425 --> 00:01:00,625
(Howard:)Had some Peanut M&M's...

